Hello all,

A heads-up that we submitted the LaTeX2e kernel release to CTAN today,
mindful of the date of the TeX Live freeze. There will be a bit of a
delay before the CTAN announcement, I guess. Code-wise this is the same
as the last DropBox update with only a few doc typos fixed at the last
moment.

Something for each of you :-)

Karl: I assume that as agreed this will not go into TL2014 but will
appear in TL2015 pre-testing from mid-April.

Christian: I'm not sure what the MiKTeX update schedule is, but it might
be worth holding off until TL2015 pretesting starts before updating in
MiKTeX so that we get a similar 'real' release date all round.

Heiko: I guess this has some impact on latex-tds!

Regards,

Joseph
